{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/54a54174b2a276e584c8dc6c58178bb1.poster.avif?t=1761099808\" width=600 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/54a54174b2a276e584c8dc6c58178bb1.webm?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Traverse a variety of locations and dive into dungeons full of monsters, puzzles, and traps to find powerful weapons, rare rings, blueprints, tools, and gold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Collect resources to build and reinforce your base, rescue survivors who assist you, and manage your resources to withstand the relentless undead threat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.poster.avif?t=1761099808\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.webm?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/5b50f0b66618d4950eab9dadbf618738.mp4?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rogue-lite Progression:</strong> Battle hordes of undead enemies, collecting their heads to gain permanent upgrades that persist across runs. Choose between permadeath or normal modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> Shape your hero with 3 distinct classes, 20 weapons that level up as you progress, 15 enchanted rings, and more than 35 upgrades, allowing you to craft a character that perfectly matches your playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.poster.avif?t=1761099808\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.webm?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/4a3550004e20928f275d1f9e66896556.mp4?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master Each Weapon:</strong> Level up your weapons through combat, unlocking new abilities and increasing their power to take on tougher foes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests:</strong> Embark on a journey to confront and defeat the terrible lich Necrosarian the Vile,  in a final battle that will determine the fate of the Everrun.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/604a4b05cea0a97105ada84745141034.poster.avif?t=1761099808\" width=616 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/604a4b05cea0a97105ada84745141034.webm?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797640/extras/604a4b05cea0a97105ada84745141034.mp4?t=1761099808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"